  "title": "The Complete Alice in Wonderland - A Note on the Text (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "A Note on the Text\n\nDUE TO the limitations of electronic formatting—and the difficulties caused by the framing of customizable font sizes—the poem “The Mouse’s Tale” does not appear in the shape of a tail (as it originally appeared in the book). The remainder of the text of Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland, however, has been meticulously prepared with full respect toward the author’s own intentions.",
